# Deploy HST len Virtualmin (Apache + Laravel + Nuxt 3 SSR)

## Kien truc

```mermaid
graph LR
    Client["Browser<br/>demo.hisotechgroup.com"] --> Apache["Apache / Virtualmin (80/443)"]
    Apache -->|"/admin, /api, /storage, /index.php"| Laravel["Laravel (PHP via FCGI)"]
    Apache -->|"/"| Nuxt["Nuxt SSR via PM2<br/>127.0.0.1:3000"]
```

> Luu y:
> - Production khong dung `php artisan serve`.
> - Laravel chay qua Apache + FCGI.
> - Nuxt chay SSR qua PM2.
> - Admin sua content thi khong can build lai Nuxt.
> - Chi build lai Nuxt khi thay doi code frontend.

---

## 1. Cau truc source khuyen nghi

Vi du source thuc te:

```text
/home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/
├── admin/
│   ├── app/
│   ├── public/
│   └── vendor/
└── client/
    ├── app/
    ├── .env
    └── .output/
```

Neu project cua anh nam trong thu muc `hisotech`, thi cac path Virtualmin/Apache phai tinh tu:

```text
/home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/
```

nen `Website documents sub-directory` phai la:

```text
hisotech/admin/public
```

khong phai:

```text
admin/public
```

---

## 2. Virtualmin

### Website documents sub-directory

Dien:

```text
hisotech/admin/public
```

Muc tieu la `DocumentRoot` thuc te sau cung phai tro toi:

```text
/home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/admin/public
```

### SSL

Cap SSL cho dung domain `demo.hisotechgroup.com`.

Khi test HTTPS bang IP, phai dung `--resolve`, neu khong se gap loi SNI sai host.

Vi du:

```bash
curl -Ik --resolve demo.hisotechgroup.com:443:212.85.24.70 https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api/menus?locale=vi
```

---

## 3. Laravel

```bash
cd /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/admin
composer install --no-dev --optimize-autoloader
cp .env.example .env
php artisan key:generate
php artisan storage:link
php artisan optimize:clear
```

Permission can thiet:

```bash
chown -R www-data:www-data storage bootstrap/cache
chmod -R 775 storage bootstrap/cache
```

Neu can:

```bash
php artisan migrate --force
```

---

## 4. Nuxt SSR

### .env production

Trong `client/.env`:

```env
NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://demo.hisotechgroup.com
NUXT_API_BASE_URL=https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api
```

Luu y:
- khong them `/` cuoi `NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`
- khong de `NUXT_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1/api` trong case Apache cua anh, vi request noi bo vao `127.0.0.1` se hit sai vhost va tra 404

### Build

```bash
cd /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/client
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
rm -rf .output .nuxt
pnpm build
```

Kiem tra build output ton tai:

```bash
ls -la .output/server/index.mjs
find .output/server -name "error-500.mjs"
find .output/server -name "error-styles*.mjs"
```

---

## 5. PM2

Khuyen nghi dung `ecosystem.config.cjs` thay vi start tay.

### ecosystem.config.cjs

```js
module.exports = {
  apps: [
    {
      name: "hst-client",
      script: ".output/server/index.mjs",
      cwd: "/home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/client",
      env: {
        NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL: "https://demo.hisotechgroup.com",
        NUXT_API_BASE_URL: "https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api",
      },
    },
  ],
};
```

### Chay PM2

```bash
cd /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/client
pm2 delete hst-client
pm2 flush
pm2 start ecosystem.config.cjs
pm2 save
pm2 env 0
```

Trong `pm2 env 0` phai thay:

```text
NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL: https://demo.hisotechgroup.com
NUXT_API_BASE_URL: https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api
```

Neu khong thay 2 bien nay, PM2 dang khong nhan env dung.

---

## 6. Apache / Virtualmin vhost

### Muc tieu route

| Request | Di dau |
|---|---|
| `/admin` | Laravel |
| `/api/*` | Laravel |
| `/storage/*` | Laravel/public storage |
| `/index.php` | Laravel |
| `/*` con lai | Nuxt SSR qua PM2 |

### Modules can bat

```bash
a2enmod proxy proxy_http proxy_wstunnel rewrite headers
```

### FCGI wrapper

Khong duoc doan mo path `php8.x.fcgi`.

Phai kiem tra file ton tai that:

```bash
ls -la /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/fcgi-bin
```

Trong server vua deploy, wrapper dung la:

```text
/home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/fcgi-bin/php8.4.fcgi
```

Neu config dung `php8.3.fcgi` khi file khong ton tai, Apache se khong reload duoc.

### Mieng cau hinh quan trong

```apache
DocumentRoot /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/admin/public

<Directory /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/admin/public>
    Options -Indexes +IncludesNOEXEC +SymLinksIfOwnerMatch +ExecCGI
    Require all granted
    AllowOverride All Options=ExecCGI,Includes,IncludesNOEXEC,Indexes,MultiViews,SymLinksIfOwnerMatch

    AddHandler fcgid-script .php
    AddHandler fcgid-script .php8.4
    FCGIWrapper /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/fcgi-bin/php8.4.fcgi .php
    FCGIWrapper /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/fcgi-bin/php8.4.fcgi .php8.4
</Directory>

ProxyPass /.well-known !
ProxyPass /index.php !
ProxyPass /admin !
ProxyPass /api !
ProxyPass /storage !
ProxyPass /vendor !
ProxyPass /build !
ProxyPass /themes !
ProxyPass /favicon.ico !
ProxyPass /robots.txt !

ProxyPreserveHost On
ProxyPass / http://127.0.0.1:3000/
ProxyPassReverse / http://127.0.0.1:3000/
```

### Luu y rat quan trong

- Khong nhet custom rewrite `RewriteRule ^ index.php [L]` vao vhost neu da de Laravel xu ly qua `.htaccess`
- Neu tu them rewrite sai, `/admin` co the bi doi thanh `/index.php` roi bi proxy nham sang Nuxt
- Khong de `RemoveHandler .php` o cuoi block neu dang dung `AddHandler` + `FCGIWrapper`

### Test Apache

Test dung host:

```bash
curl -I -H "Host: demo.hisotechgroup.com" http://212.85.24.70/admin
curl -I -H "Host: demo.hisotechgroup.com" "http://212.85.24.70/api/menus?locale=vi"
curl -Ik --resolve demo.hisotechgroup.com:443:212.85.24.70 "https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api/widgets/layout?locale=vi"
```

Neu `api` ra `200`, vhost da dung.

---

## 7. Trinh tu deploy dung

### Khi deploy lan dau

1. Upload source
2. Cau hinh Virtualmin `hisotech/admin/public`
3. Cau hinh vhost Apache
4. Setup Laravel
5. Setup `client/.env`
6. `pnpm build`
7. Start PM2 bang ecosystem

### Khi chi thay doi code frontend

```bash
cd /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/client
git pull
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
rm -rf .output .nuxt
pnpm build
pm2 restart hst-client --update-env
```

### Khi chi thay doi content trong admin

Khong can build lai Nuxt.

Chi can reload trang vi SSR fetch API moi request.

### Khi thay doi code backend Laravel

```bash
cd /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/admin
git pull
composer install --no-dev --optimize-autoloader
php artisan optimize:clear
```

Neu co migration:

```bash
php artisan migrate --force
```

---

## 8. Loi thuong gap

### 1. PM2 log van goi `http://127.0.0.1/api/...`

Nguyen nhan:
- `.env` da doi nhung PM2/build chua an env moi

Cach xu ly:
- build lai sau khi export env dung
- dung `ecosystem.config.cjs`
- kiem tra `pm2 env 0`

### 2. `curl http://127.0.0.1/api/...` tra 404

Khong duoc ket luan ngay la Laravel hong.

Voi Apache name-based vhost, `127.0.0.1` co the hit sai default vhost.
Phai test voi host dung:

```bash
curl -I -H "Host: demo.hisotechgroup.com" "http://212.85.24.70/api/menus?locale=vi"
```

hoac HTTPS + `--resolve`.

### 3. `/admin` bi nhay thanh `/index.php`

Nguyen nhan:
- vhost co custom rewrite sai

Cach xu ly:
- bo rewrite tu viet trong vhost
- de Laravel `.htaccess` xu ly
- dam bao `/index.php` va `/admin` duoc exclude khoi proxy

### 4. Apache reload fail vi `php8.3.fcgi` khong ton tai

Nguyen nhan:
- wrapper dung sai version/path

Cach xu ly:
- `ls -la .../fcgi-bin`
- dung dung file ton tai that, vi du `php8.4.fcgi`

### 5. Tren Linux bi loi namespace, local Windows khong bi

Vi du:

```php
use App\shortcode\Contracts\ShortcodeInterface;
```

tren Linux se sai neu namespace thuc te la:

```php
use App\Shortcode\Contracts\ShortcodeInterface;
```

Windows thuong khong lo do filesystem khong phan biet hoa thuong, Linux thi co.

Can ra cac case nay:

```bash
grep -R "App\\\\shortcode" app -n
```

### 6. Endpoint backend mot minh bi `500`, local khong bi

Thuong la do:
- du lieu DB server khac local
- media/storage server khac local
- config/theme/widget cache khac local
- namespace case-sensitive tren Linux

Khong nen ket luan ngay la Nuxt loi.

---

## 9. Lenh debug huu ich

### Apache

```bash
apachectl -t
apachectl -S
apachectl -M | grep rewrite
systemctl reload apache2
```

### PM2

```bash
pm2 status
pm2 logs hst-client --lines 100
pm2 env 0
pm2 flush
```

### Laravel/API

```bash
curl -Ik --resolve demo.hisotechgroup.com:443:212.85.24.70 "https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api/menus?locale=vi"
curl -Ik --resolve demo.hisotechgroup.com:443:212.85.24.70 "https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api/widgets/layout?locale=vi"
curl -Ik --resolve demo.hisotechgroup.com:443:212.85.24.70 "https://demo.hisotechgroup.com/api/pages/homepage/sections?locale=vi"
```

### Logs

```bash
tail -n 100 /var/log/virtualmin/demo.hisotechgroup.com_error_log
find /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/admin/storage/logs -maxdepth 1 -type f
tail -n 100 /home/hisotechgroup.com/domains/demo.hisotechgroup.com/hisotech/admin/storage/logs/*.log
```

---

## 10. Checklist chot production

- Virtualmin sub-directory dung: `hisotech/admin/public`
- Apache vhost exclude dung cac route Laravel khoi proxy
- FCGI wrapper dung file ton tai that
- `NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` va `NUXT_API_BASE_URL` vao duoc PM2
- `.output/server/index.mjs` ton tai sau build
- `/api/menus` va `/api/widgets/layout` tra `200`
- Nuxt homepage render duoc
- khong con namespace sai hoa-thuong tren Linux
